{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/25d6822a412daa19531cc125006debf7.poster.avif?t=1773251424\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/25d6822a412daa19531cc125006debf7.webm?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/25d6822a412daa19531cc125006debf7.mp4?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not the hero. You\u2019re in charge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Acceptable Losses</i>, you're the officer behind the lines. Make hard calls, assign missions, and push paperwork while your men bleed for inches of mud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings new orders. Assign squads to patrols, trench repairs, or suicidal assaults. At night, manage the incoming paperwork. Read incident reports, check medical updates, scan intel briefings, and hope for reinforcements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your duty to HQ with the lives of the men under your command. Just survive twenty days. That\u2019s all they ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/3eaf03df219427ab0457a38383f82a14.poster.avif?t=1773251424\" width=980 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/3eaf03df219427ab0457a38383f82a14.webm?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/3eaf03df219427ab0457a38383f82a14.mp4?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ Missions including both mundane and suicidal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Modifiers ranging from morale and fatigue to weather and enemy defense state</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70+ Mid-Mission Events impacting mission modifiers and outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/f6d21ca6167409df8bf13ea32bf6ac8a.poster.avif?t=1773251424\" width=788 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/f6d21ca6167409df8bf13ea32bf6ac8a.webm?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/extras/f6d21ca6167409df8bf13ea32bf6ac8a.mp4?t=1773251424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Night Events modifying your squads, trench condition, supplies, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated soldiers with millions of combinations including first and last name, birth place and date</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath of soldiers within your squads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your squads on missions for a boost but not without immunity to wounds\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HQ Evaluations show you how well, or poorly, you are doing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884200?t=1773251424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884200/a627dc588d75fe3b0d5a89156915ef97737ce04c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773251424","capsule_image":"